The folders in the "figures" directory correspond to the paper figures as follows:

| Figure   | Folder                                |
| -------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Figure 1 | Spectral_diversity                    |
| Figure 2 | selective_network_entrainment         |
| Figure 3 | Network_entrainment_different_OP      |
| Figure 4 | Entrainment_across_sensory _cortices   |
| Figure 5 | eeg_comparison                        |



The "onset_phase" and "amplitude_analysis" folders contain additional analyses described in the paper’s supplementary material.

